senses.example:
Who CALL me? Listen down de ribber, Dinah! Don’t you hyar
Somebody holl’in’ “Hoo, Jim, hoo?” My Sarah died las’ y’ar;
IS dat black angel done come back to call ole Jim f’om hyar?

